{"text":"And so, it was not until I had opened myself up to the possibility of failing that I was able to find success in clown class. Without the possibility of being bad, you will never be extraordinary. And so, I resolved to operate from a sense of self that was louder than my critic and faster than my worry. It is only in that space that you can truly be free and innovate. Right before I graduated, the opportunity to play Patsy was offered to me. After a rigorous audition period, when Steve McQueen, the director, called me to give me the part, I remember I sat down on the pavement, overjoyed and horrified by the prospect of working alongside such seasoned artists. It was a dream come true, but my saboteur, the saboteur in me would have me believe that it had come true too fast and that I was not prepared for it. I was suffering from typical imposter syndrome.","words":[{"text":"And","start":0.0,"end":0.62},{"text":"so","start":0.62,"end":0.98,"punct":","},{"text":"it","start":1.32,"end":1.6},{"text":"was","start":1.6,"end":1.72},{"text":"not","start":1.72,"end":1.92},{"text":"until","start":1.92,"end":2.2},{"text":"I","start":2.2,"end":2.4},{"text":"had","start":2.4,"end":2.92},{"text":"opened","start":2.92,"end":3.36},{"text":"myself","start":3.36,"end":3.88},{"text":"up","start":3.88,"end":4.18},{"text":"to","start":4.18,"end":4.38},{"text":"the","start":4.38,"end":4.52},{"text":"possibility","start":4.52,"end":5.04},{"text":"of","start":5.04,"end":5.62},{"text":"failing","start":5.62,"end":6.04},{"text":"that","start":6.04,"end":6.78},{"text":"I","start":6.78,"end":6.96},{"text":"was","start":6.96,"end":7.1},{"text":"able","start":7.1,"end":7.36},{"text":"to","start":7.36,"end":7.62},{"text":"find","start":7.62,"end":7.88},{"text":"success","start":7.88,"end":8.32},{"text":"in","start":8.32,"end":8.8},{"text":"clown","start":8.8,"end":9.06},{"text":"class","start":9.06,"end":9.48,"punct":"."},{"text":"Without","start":10.24,"end":10.52},{"text":"the","start":